@startuml
title Scenario (C4+1) - Book Appointment (SUCCESS) - CQRS + Async Notes

hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Paciente/Cliente" as User
participant "Nginx Ingress" as Ingress
participant "appointments-service\nAppointmentController" as AppCtrl
participant "appointments-service\nSagaOrchestrator" as Saga
participant "auth-service\nJWT Validation" as Auth
participant "clients-service" as Clients
participant "doctors-service" as Doctors
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ

database "Event Store\n(append-only)" as ES
database "Write DB\n(appointments)" as WDB

participant "ProjectionUpdater\n(appointments)" as ProjApp
database "Read Model DB\n(appointments-query)" as RDBApp

participant "notes-service\nEventConsumer" as NotesConsumer
database "MongoDB\n(notes)" as NotesDB

== Command (Write side) ==
User -> Ingress : POST /appointments\n(Authorization: Bearer JWT)
Ingress -> AppCtrl : forward request

AppCtrl -> Auth : validate JWT + roles/scopes
Auth --> AppCtrl : OK (claims)

AppCtrl -> Saga : startSaga(BookAppointmentCommand)\n(correlationId)

== Saga Steps (success path) ==
Saga -> ES : append AppointmentRequested
ES --> Saga : ack

Saga -> Clients : ValidateClient(clientId)\n(REST)
Clients --> Saga : ClientValid

Saga -> Doctors : ReserveSlot(doctorId, timeSlot)\n(REST)
Doctors --> Saga : SlotReserved(reservationId)

== Commit (Write DB + Event) ==
Saga -> WDB : persist appointment state = BOOKED
WDB --> Saga : OK

Saga -> ES : append AppointmentCreatedEvent
ES --> Saga : ack

Saga -> MQ : publish AppointmentCreatedEvent\n(correlationId, appointmentId, clientId, doctorId, timeSlot)
MQ --> Saga : ack

== Async Projections (Query side) ==
MQ -> ProjApp : deliver AppointmentCreatedEvent
ProjApp -> RDBApp : update read model
RDBApp --> ProjApp : OK

== Async Notes Creation ==
MQ -> NotesConsumer : deliver AppointmentCreatedEvent
NotesConsumer -> NotesDB : create initial notes record
NotesDB --> NotesConsumer : OK
NotesConsumer -> MQ : publish NotesCreated\n(optional)
MQ --> NotesConsumer : ack

== Response ==
Saga --> AppCtrl : success(appointmentId)
AppCtrl --> Ingress : 201 Created + appointmentId
Ingress --> User : 201 Created

@enduml
